<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "Available Games")}</.help_h4>
<.help_game_list kind={:multiplayer} />

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_game_pong}>{dgettext("help_games", "How to Open a Game")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Double-click the Retro Games desktop icon, or open Start ▸ Games and choose Retro Games. The folder shows one icon per game."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_games", "The icon of a game opens the page of the game, on top of the chat.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The catalogue of games and the channel of each game lead to the same page."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "The Page of a Game")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "The Play tab lists the game and each of its modes.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Against the computer opens the game in a tab of its own. Choose Easy, Normal or Hard there, then click Play vs AI."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Find a partner takes you to the channel of the game and offers a seat there, like the command %{command}.",
      command: "/lfg"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "To play with somebody you know, type their nickname and click Invite. It works like the command %{command}.",
      command: "/challenge"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "%{link} gives you a link to send to a friend.",
      link: dgettext("games", "Create a match link")
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "In the Live tab, you see who is playing and which matches you can watch."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The Ranking tab lists the best players of the game."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The You tab shows your rating and your latest results."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_games", "The last tab is the channel of the game, with its latest lines.")}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_game_pong}>{dgettext("help_games", "The address is the door")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Every game has an address of its own, such as %{address}. Send someone the address and they land on the same game.",
      address: "/play/hex_pong"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "A game tab and the chat run side by side. Opening one does not close the other, and closing the game tab leaves the chat untouched."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Use the Chat link in the game window's status bar to go back."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_link}>{dgettext("help_games", "Sharing a Game")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "With a game selected, press Share. You get a short link you can paste anywhere — a channel, a private message, or outside RetroHexChat entirely."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Whoever opens the link sees a card telling them what was shared. If they have no session yet they connect first and land back on the link."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Sharing needs a registered nickname, because the link records who created it. Register with /ns register first."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "How It Plays")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "In Hex Pong, you control the left paddle with Arrow Up / Arrow Down or W / S while the AI controls the right paddle. In Light Trails, use the arrow keys or WASD to steer and trap the AI before either trail hits a wall or occupied cell. In Star Duel variants, rotate, thrust, and fire with Space while the AI dogfights as player 2. In Block Breakers, move the bottom paddle with Left/Right or A/D while the AI covers the top paddle. In Hex Warlords, move the left shield with Up/Down or W/S, hold Space to catch, and release to launch at the AI castle. In Hex Raid variants, fly the left jet with Arrow keys or WASD, fire with Space, and use Shift for mines when the variant allows them. In Hex Outlaw, dodge visible bullets, line up your shot, and fire with Space or Shift. In Hex Tennis, move across your half, serve with Space or Shift, and let the AI cover the far court. In Hex Invaders, move with Left/Right or A/D, fire with Space, and let the AI clear the other cannon lane. In Hex Enduro, change lanes with Left/Right or A/D, accelerate and brake with Up/Down or W/S, and trigger turbo with Space or Shift. In Hex Skiing, steer with Left/Right or A/D, clear slalom gates, dodge obstacles, and outrun the avalanche when the variant has one. In Hex Frost, move with Arrow keys or WASD, jump between ice rows with Up/Down or W/S, build the igloo, and avoid arctic enemies. In Hex Hockey, skate with Arrow keys or WASD, shoot or tackle with Space or Shift, and challenge the AI from the far side."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Hex Jungle is a game for one player: move with the arrow keys or WASD, jump with the space bar, and climb ladders with Up and Down."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Hex Solitaire is a game of cards for one player, played with the mouse or a finger: tap a card to move it to its place, or drag it onto another pile."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "In Hex Boxing, move in 8 directions, manage range, and tap Space or Shift to punch while the AI fights from the right side."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "In Pixel Tanks, rotate with Left/Right or A/D, drive forward with Up or W, and fire with Space or Shift while the AI navigates the maze as player 2."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_games", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-arcade">{dgettext("help_games", "Arcade")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-universal-lobby">
    {dgettext("help_games", "P2P Session")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
